@startuml
title Connected Operational History — from Identity to Evidence

left to right direction

rectangle "Identity\nPerson → Tenant → Journey" as Identity
rectangle "Operation\nWork Period → Production" as Operation
rectangle "Value\nAppropriation → Expense" as Value
rectangle "Control\nCurrent Account → Receipt" as Control

Identity --> Operation : who works and in which context
Operation --> Value : work and production generate value
Value --> Control : credit and debit preserve the origin

note bottom of Control		
The balance and the pending items remain
linked to the events that originated them.	
end note

@enduml
